### Cleaner App - API Auth Tests
### Fichier de test pour les endpoints d'authentification
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### ==================== AUTHENTIFICATION ====================

### 1. Inscription d'un nouvel utilisateur citoyen
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "phone": "+237698765432",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Mbiya",
  "role": "CITIZEN"
}

### 2. Inscription d'un agent HYSACAM
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "agent@hysacam.cm",
  "phone": "+237612345678",
  "password": "agentpass123",
  "confirmPassword": "agentpass123",
  "firstName": "Paul",
  "lastName": "Tchouante",
  "role": "AGENT"
}

### 3. Inscription avec quartier spécifique
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "douala@cleaner.cm",
  "phone": "+237655555555",
  "password": "douala123",
  "confirmPassword": "douala123",
  "firstName": "Marie",
  "lastName": "Douala",
  "neighborhoodId": "uuid-du-quartier-ici",
  "role": "CITIZEN"
}

### 4. Inscription minimale (champs requis seulement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "minimal@cleaner.cm",
  "phone": "+237600000000",
  "password": "min123",
  "confirmPassword": "min123"
}

### 5. Connexion utilisateur
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================== TOKEN MANAGEMENT ====================

### 6. Rafraîchir le token d'accès
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "votre-refresh-token-ici"
}

### 7. Déconnexion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer votre-access-token-ici

{
  "refresh_token": "votre-refresh-token-ici"
}

### ==================== OTP VERIFICATION ====================

### 8. Envoyer OTP pour vérification email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "citoyen@cleaner.cm"
}

### 9. Envoyer OTP par SMS
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "+237698765432"
}

### 10. Vérifier OTP pour activation de compte
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "code": "123456",
  "purpose": "VERIFY_EMAIL"
}

### 11. Demander réinitialisation mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-password-reset
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "citoyen@cleaner.cm"
}

### 12. Réinitialiser mot de passe avec OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### ==================== GOOGLE AUTH (optionnel) ====================

### 13. Authentification Google (redirection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google

### 14. Callback Google OAuth2
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/callback

### ==================== PROFILE ====================

### 15. Obtenir le profil utilisateur connecté
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer votre-access-token-ici

### ==================== TESTS D'ERREURS ====================

### 16. Test inscription email invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "email-invalide",
  "phone": "+237698765432",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123"
}

### 17. Test inscription mots de passe différents
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@cleaner.cm",
  "phone": "+237698765433",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "different123"
}

### 18. Test inscription email déjà utilisé
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "phone": "+237698765434",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123"
}

### 19. Test connexion identifiants invalides
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 20. Test OTP invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "citoyen@cleaner.cm",
  "code": "000000",
  "purpose": "VERIFY_EMAIL"
}

